  SlotStartWrongHost, SlotStartRefused, SlotStartAlreadyActive, SlotStartInvocationUnread, SlotStartInvocationUnchanged, SlotStartStillActiveAtBound, UnitPropertyUnread, ControllerReceiptUnreadable, InvocationWaitRefused,
